Copyright 2026 NeuralNexusNote / ArnolfJp019

This product is part of the NeuralNexusNote project and is distributed as
the free "Lite" (ephemeral / Redis-backed) build of N3MemoryCore.
From version 2.0.0 it is N3MC-Free + MCP, with Redis as the database:
hooks, a CLI and a resident server for Claude Code, and an MCP entry for
other applications.

This product includes portions derived from N3MC-Free (n3memorycore-free):
the Claude Code hooks, the resident server and the CLI, adapted to Lite's
Redis storage and Lite's search and save rules. N3MC-Free is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. A summary of the changes is provided in
MODIFICATIONS.md.

